---
/** EV chargers intro: AXI EVOO sub-brand logo plus a short line overview. */
---

<section class="section evoo-intro">
  <div class="container-site evoo-intro__grid">
    <div class="evoo-intro__logo" data-anim="left">
      <img
        src="/images/brand/axi-evoo-logo.webp"
        alt="AXI EVOO"
        width="1185"
        height="168"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="evoo-intro__copy" data-anim="up" data-anim-delay="0.1">
      <h2>AXI EVOO EV charging</h2>
      <p>
        AXI EVOO is the EV charging range from AXI SOLAR: portable and wall-mounted AC chargers from
        3.5 to 22 kW, and DC fast chargers from 20 to 240 kW. AC units are available with GB/T,
        Type 2 or Type 1 / NACS connectors; DC units with CCS1, CCS2, CHAdeMO, GB/T or NACS.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every model below links to its full parameter table and datasheet, including supply cable
        sizing for DC installations.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .evoo-intro__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .evoo-intro__logo img { width: 100%; max-width: 30rem; height: auto; }
  .evoo-intro__copy h2 { margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: var(--text-h3); }
  .evoo-intro__copy p + p { margin-top: 0.75rem; }

  @media (max-width: 991px) {
    .evoo-intro__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
    .evoo-intro__logo img { max-width: 20rem; }
  }
</style>
